            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESecurity patches are available for Umbraco versions 16 and 17 to fix three moderate-to-high vulnerabilities. Upgrade now to secure your CMS. Projects on Umbraco Cloud will automatically receive the fixes.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://umbraco.com/blog/umbraco-cms-security-advisory-march-10-2026-security-patches-are-now-available/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
